  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Counseling to help 62 Iraqi Suicidal bombers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BAORD plan to expand existing counselling offered in Iraq  zoom, particularly to those who self harm or have suicidal thinking. This project would subsidise 250 more counselling hours and 50 more support group hours, to those who are in need. In 2022 there were three times more male suicides than female; highest age group was 22-38 years for men and 20-35 years for women. BAORD seek to offer help and hope to those struggling with poor mental health.</narrative>
  </description>
